<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>转载 on 如是有为</title><link>https://sensor.fans/tags/%E8%BD%AC%E8%BD%BD/</link><description>Recent content in 转载 on 如是有为</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sensor.fans/tags/%E8%BD%AC%E8%BD%BD/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>长线传输吃掉信号质量：模拟正余弦 vs 数字协议</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-dmhqtmqr21reif4_6hdiiq/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-dmhqtmqr21reif4_6hdiiq/</guid><description>&lt;div class="wechat-reprint">
&lt;img alt="长线传输与信号质量技术封面" decoding="async" loading="eager" src="https://sensor.fans/images/wx/wechat-dmhqtmqr21reif4_6hdiiq-001-dbfe4291f6f8.png"/>&lt;p>实验室台架上，这台编码器的角度重复性是 0.01°。装进设备、拉上三米线缆，抖动直接放大十倍，EMC 预测试还扫出一根超标尖峰。芯片没换、参数没动、算法没改——变的是那根线。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>线缆是编码器系统里最便宜、也最常被低估的器件。而且模拟正余弦信号和数字协议信号，被线缆伤害的方式&lt;strong>完全不同&lt;/strong>——用同一套布线思路对付两者，等于哪儿都防了、哪儿都没防住。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>国产替代喊到 85%，华大九天还是没人敢签核</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-3k9lfncyxm5j-fgwuwkfdq/</link><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:15:52 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-3k9lfncyxm5j-fgwuwkfdq/</guid><description>&lt;div class="wechat-reprint">
&lt;p>华大九天在工博会上报了个数：国产 EDA 工具覆盖率从不到 30% 涨到 85%。没想到这个好消息没换来掌声，工程圈反手一句「不该高兴」，吵的是这数当不当得真。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>人形机器人进入“立规矩”时代，帕西尼参编首批5项国标中的3项</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-abyg9ozbkafjgjch201cgq/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/wechat-abyg9ozbkafjgjch201cgq/</guid><description>&lt;div class="wechat-reprint">
&lt;div class="wechat-article-content">&lt;section data-mpa-md-root="t" data-mpa-uuid="cfa01603b2514237dc8ad4e39723ac84" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_zv8ra2ss">&lt;section data-pm-slice='3 4 ["para",{"tagName":"section","attributes":{"style":"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);"},"namespaceURI":"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","data-layout-id":null}]' data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_xxfshu0o">&lt;p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_j83iepz1">&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">把技术做成产品，把实践写进国标——中国人形机器人的产业实力，正从头部企业一线经验里生长出来。&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&lt;section data-pm-slice="2 4 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_gwmkdypd">&lt;section data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_6gixcl9p" nodeleaf="">&lt;img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://sensor.fans/images/wx/wechat-abyg9ozbkafjgjch201cgq-002-3fe34a9595ac.png"/>&lt;/section>&lt;section data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_sbr9fthz">&lt;section data-pm-slice="2 4 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_tk8rlcyn">&lt;section data-pm-slice="2 4 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_93y8t55g">&lt;p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_59db25ci">&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">央视新闻报道首批人形机器人国家标准发布&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&lt;/section>&lt;/section>&lt;/section>&lt;/section>&lt;section data-pm-slice="2 4 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_fqzjwae9">&lt;h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_1071jq0t">&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">近期，《人形机器人技术要求》系列首批5项国家标准正式发布，帕西尼作为主要起草单位之一，深度参&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">与《环境感知》《决策规划》《运动控制》3项标准编制。这三项标准恰好贯穿人形机器人从感知、决策到执行的核心链路，&lt;/span>&lt;span textstyle="">全部落在人形机器人的核心能力上&lt;/span>&lt;span textstyle="">。&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/h2>&lt;/section>&lt;/section>&lt;/section>&lt;p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_4zekk594">&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">这组“&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">3/5”背后，既有帕西尼持续参与标准建设的行业积累，更集中呈现了帕西尼贯通不同技术环节的全栈能力及规模交付验证的工程实力。&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&lt;p data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_b6jyukj3">&lt;span leaf="">&lt;br/>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&lt;h4 data-pm-slice="2 2 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_pci6us50">&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">01 &lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/h4>&lt;h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_qsly5bze">&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">首批5项参编3项，贯穿人形机器人核心链路&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/h2>&lt;p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_gbp3rcax">&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">人形机器人产业向纵深发展，技术突破的价值，需要在感知、决策与执行的系统协同中得到检验。此次参编的三项标准，分别对这些关键环节提出能力要求，并通过相互衔接，为整机研发与应用提供技术依据。&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&lt;section data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_ge0ak84t" nodeleaf="">&lt;img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://sensor.fans/images/wx/wechat-abyg9ozbkafjgjch201cgq-003-63eb6b99f5de.png"/>&lt;/section>&lt;p data-pm-slice="2 2 []" data-review-block-id="arb_mvouzq71_jb3yuky4">&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">《环境感知》关注机器人对外部环境信息的获取与理解。传感器与软件协同，支撑机器人识别空间、人员和障碍物，感知结果则为后续决策与安全行动提供依据&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span leaf="">&lt;span textstyle="">。&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>